# Local caches, virtualenvs, and build output are never part of a deployment.
# Keep this to genuinely-unwanted paths only: both the Web project (root
# directory `apps/web`) and the Worker project (root directory `ingest`) deploy
# from this repository, and a broad ignore here would silently drop the files a
# project needs (e.g. `apps/web` and the workspace packages for the Next.js app).
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.next/
**/.vite/
**/out/
*.pyc
